Set FontSize 12
Set Width 600
Set Height 400
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "firstlight new sky-survey"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "Mapping the night sky, one star at a time."
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "ls sky-survey"
Enter
Sleep 4s
